          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 13:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho baidhukira ebyaligho eira mu biseera bya Musa omugheereza wa Musengwa Katonda, baabuuza bati: “Musengwa Katonda ali gha, eyasomosa abakulembeze b'abantu n'abawonia enhandha? Musengwa Katonda oyo ali gha, eyasindika omwoyo gwe omutukuvu mu bantu be? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda oyo ali gha, eyakozesa obuyinza bwe, n'akola eby'amaani ng'abita mu Musa, n'ayawulamu amaadhi g'enhandha ng'abantu babona olwo eriina lya Musengwa Katonda oyo ni limanhikananga ebyanda n'ebyanda?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yababisa mu nhandha ghagati nga tibeekontola naku, ng'oti n'embalaasi bw'ebita mu irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoyo gwa Musengwa Katonda gwagha abantu ba Musengwa Katonda oyo okuwuumula, baaba ng'oti n'ente edhitwaliibwa mu kiiko ekigimu. Kale Musengwa Katonda atyo yaabakulemberamu era yaaleetera eriina lye okugheebwanga ekitiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wo Musengwa Katonda, ng'oli eyo mu igulu y'oba mu butukuvu bwo ni mu kitiisa kyo, ganha otulingeku eno ghansi. Okutulumirwa kwo n'amaani go biri gha? Obwo tokaatugonza, waire okutusaasira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwenebwene n'iwe Iseife. Waire dhaadha waife Aburahamu tatwidhi, era nga ni Yakobo takyatula, iwe niiwe Iseife Omununuzi waife, okuva eira n'eira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wo Musengwa Katonda, lwaki otuleka okudaaliima ni tuva ku ngira y'otwoleka? Lwaki oleetera emyoyo gyaife okukalanguka ni tutakutya? Ganha oire ye tuli, ku lw'abantu bo abagheereza bo, abantu ababo ku bubwo ab'omu bika bya Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
